A||||17||Oreif||Nostrodomous Predictions. The real ones. ||||2||
Z||000000||Oreif||09-12-2001||06:57 PM||||Warning: Long post.<P>This site, <A HREF="http://www.crystalinks.com/quatrains.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.crystalinks.com/quatrains.html</A> <BR>Has a break down of Nostrodomous' Quatrains.<P>The link above references what happened yesterday and a brief rundown of how WWIII<BR>will be fought.<BR> <P><BR><I>At forty-five degrees, the sky will burn,Fire approaches the great new city, Immediately a huge, scattered flame leaps upWhen they want to have verification from the Norman (Century VI, Quatrain 97)</I><P>New York Is near the 45 Degree latitude.<P><I>By fire he will destroy their city, A cold and cruel heart, Blood will pour, Mercy to none. Earth-shaking fire from the center of the earth.will cause the towers around the New City to shake,Two great rocks for a long time will make war ,And then Arethusa will color a new river red. (Century 1, Quatrain 87)</I><P>The Eastern kings shall carry out the Divine Justice. Turkey shall be devastated.<BR>The regions subjected to Muslim armies Shall cause mountains trembling with great war Prisoners of both sexes and throughout Turkey One shall cry at dawn from land to land The full-scaled invasion from the sea.<BR>From Monaco as far as Sicily All the coast demolished and desolate There shall not be any more suburb, city, nor village That the Muslim invaders shall leave undone<BR>Russian troop shall advance over high mountains.<BR>The Russians through an military good fortune Shall be elevated to a high degree Shall change their prince, one born in a province Shall pass sea, troop shall climb over high mountains<BR>Russia's leadership shall belong to an outsider who shall appeal to the common population. Russian troops shall attack Western Europe or more specifically Italy via two routes : from the south near the Black Sea andfrom the north by crossing the Alps.<BR>The mass shall approach coming from Russia The ancient Destroyer shall ruin the city Violently desolated Romanie shall see Afterwards the great flame of war shall not be quenched<BR>Russian navy shall dominate only for two short years. <BR>Russia shall be in the state of desperation nationwide. Each personshall have to survive on his ownwithout relying on his government (Verse 2). Russia's power and her very existence shall be threatened due to the European offences and later by the bloody hands of the neighboring China. Their navy shall dominate the war for the first two years then shall collapse due to the lack of spare parts and resources.<BR>At the onset of WW III or European war, Spain and Italy shall quickly fall into Muslim hands and later become Eastern allies ( We have to remember that the Muslim populations in those two countries are quite large,probably majority by now in Spain.) Tunisia and Algeria shall side with Iran. French fleet shall be sunk in Adriatic Sealeaving Marseilles naked.<BR>French fleet shall be wrecked in Adriatic Sea by a surprised attack by Muslims. The Muslim extremists loyal to Iran shall dominate all Muslim governments around the region.<BR>After defeating French navy in Adriatic Sea, the Muslims shall advance to Marseilles through Spain. Marseilles shall be vulnerable due to no protection from French navy.<BR>Throughout Marseilles the inhabitants shall change French citizens shall flee as far as Lyon Narbonne and Toulouse shall become outraged by Bordeaux Killed, captured, almost one million French<BR>Upon Mount Bailley and Bresse Shall be hidden in Genoa fierce weapons Beyond Lyon and Vienna, great hail upon them Languished on the ground, less than one third shall survive<BR>Great Britain including England By sea shall suffer great floods The new league including Italy shall raise war against her Italy herself shall dress all her wounds<BR>USA shall exert a great effort Across the Atlantic Ocean to open English shore The sovereignty of England shall be reinstated As London is trembling in discovering enemy sails<BR>In the grassy fields of Alein and Varneigne Upon Mount Lebron near Durance Conflict between two sides shall be very fierce Mesopotamie shall fall on French soil<BR>By River Danube and Rhine shall come to drink The great Camel which shall not repent Trembling is River Rhone and most violent for those near River Loire And near Alps the ****  shall ruin them<BR>War shall be elevated to its highest Italians shall retreat from France Inhabitants in Lombardy shall be terrified Of those hawkish (brutal) troops who carry out the Divine Justice<BR>In the fields of Media, Arabe, and Armenia Two great armies shall assemble three times Near the Arabic shore or Persian Gulf The Israelites on land shall tumble<BR>Saturn and Mars in Leo, Spain captive Lybian chief in the battle shall be caught Near Malta, the heralded Prince (Henry) shall be cheered And Roman Scepter shall be struck by a Frenchman<BR>At the great battle of Armageddon Shall join the crusade through rows totally attached The pertanious army of God against the army of the evil Serpent The Dragon shall be loosened on October third<P>||||reg||2
Z||000001||Cliff Pennock||09-12-2001||07:37 PM||||First of all I want to say that I think Nostradamus quatrains can be interpreted in many ways. That said, I've gone through the quatrains and found two that bare an eerie resemblance to what happened yesterday. I haven't found a mention of it yet anywhere on the net, so let me post it here with my interpretation (in blue) - and it's not far fetched at all:<P><FONT SIZE="3"><B><u>Quatrain 82, Century X</u></B></FONT><BR><B>Cries, weeping, tears will come with knives,</B><BR><FONT SIZE="1"><FONT COLOR="blue">(The hijacking of the airplanes by terrorists with knives)</FONT></FONT><BR><B>Seeming to flee, they will deliver a final attack,</B><BR><FONT SIZE="1"><FONT COLOR="blue">(Often, hijacks are to flee to a certain country, but instead they deliver an attack)</FONT></FONT><BR><B>Parks around to set up high platforms,</B><BR><FONT SIZE="1"><FONT COLOR="blue">("High platforms" - the WTC, "Parks around" - WTC is surrounded by many parks; City Hall Park, Rockefeller Park, Rober Wagner Park)</FONT></FONT><BR><B>The living pushed back and murdered instantly.</B><BR><FONT SIZE="1"><FONT COLOR="blue">(The victims in the towers)</FONT></FONT><P>The quatrain that immediately follows, is also very interesting, and might hint on what will happen:<P><FONT SIZE="3"><B><u>Quatrain 83, Century X</u></B></FONT><BR><B>The signal to give battle will not be given,<BR>They will be obliged to go out of the park:<BR>The banner around Ghent will be recognized,<BR>Of him who will cause all his followers to be put to death.</B><P>||||reg||1
Z||000002||Oreif||09-12-2001||08:26 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Cliff Pennock:<BR><B><P><FONT SIZE="3">[b]<u>Quatrain 82, Century X</u></B></FONT><BR><B>The living pushed back and murdered instantly.</B><BR><FONT SIZE="1"><FONT COLOR="blue">(The victims in the towers)</FONT></FONT><P><BR>[/B]<HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Cliff, It is also rumored the hijackers forced the passengers to the rear of the plane. But like you say they can be interpreted in many ways. It's just eerie that alot of things that have happened can be matched to something written centuries before.||||reg||1
Z||000003||Urchin||09-12-2001||09:11 PM||||I came across some last night that were quite similar to the events that took place yesterday.  Can't seem to find them now.  All I can remember is one mentioning enemies from the sky targeting New York and France retaliating.  And another mentioning that the incident would be much more complex than appears, then leaders of the U.S. and it's alies would encounter conflict between them due to lack of communication...  there was more.  Of course this from memory so I don't know how accurate it is    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">, I'm still trying to find it.  It was interesting.  These were all supposed steps towards WW3<BR>Throughout the article he kept reffering to the Antichrist as the responsible party<BR>[This message has been edited by Urchin (edited 09-12-2001).]<p>[This message has been edited by Urchin (edited 09-12-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000004||Black88GT||09-12-2001||09:16 PM||||I think Cliffs findings are pretty scary.  <P>Oreifs post sounds like B.S.  (not Oreif, whoever wrote it)<P>It says that Russian troops will attack "Wester Europe or more specifically Italy" through the Alps.  It doesnt make any sense to go through the Alps.  <P>Then it says Russias navy will dominate for 2 years.  Dominate who?  Arbas have like gunships, no carriers, battleships, destroyers or subs.  Dominate the Chinese? Why would they get involved?  Who would they join?<P>Also, how would the Muslims organize such a massive invasion by sea?  The logistics and resources needed would be tremendous.  Doesn't seem possible if they are being controlled by some islamic militants.  <P>Why would America need to "open English shore"  I guess they mean English channel.  What Navy do the Muslims have?  I thought the Russians were supposed to be dominating at this time?<P>Sounds like someone is writing stories to me.  <p>[This message has been edited by Black88GT (edited 09-12-2001).]||||reg||1
